  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile/avgpool setup, comparing it to the scvi_n200 encoder (llm_summary_004) in the same configuration. Validation accuracy (0.5305) and F1 (0.5152) are lower than scvi_n200's performance, suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence results. However, the exact contribution of encoder complexity versus other design factors remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative encoders or aggregation methods."
